Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/19] FreeChat: remove per-account data of sessions that no
 longer exist

Session preferences, push settings and the push client secret (keyed by user ID)
outlive a strict session whose process was killed. They are removed at start-up
for every account not in the session store.
